                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.24/143: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-05-04T20:00:00-04:00">May 4, 1931—8
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>36. Please report by telegraph results of any representations made by you in
                    compliance with the Department’s instruction No. 90, dated January 22.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
